{"5074790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "StarCalibur", "steam_appid": 5074790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brutal interstellar war is raging. Humanity has been forced to abandon much of the explored galaxy to a mysterious alien race. The aliens continue to hold the initiative on the front lines, while their motives and ultimate goals remain unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a graduate of the Flight Academy, beginning your internship aboard the training carrier <strong>Angler</strong>. Before long, this once peaceful corner of space becomes the epicenter of an interstellar conflict!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced action space combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missions in deep space and above planetary surfaces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed planetary environments featuring both man-made structures and natural landscapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of ground vehicles during planetary missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new weapons as you progress, with more than 8 unique weapon types available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your ship throughout the campaign, improving maneuverability, acceleration, and energy capacity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two gameplay perspectives: first-person or third-person.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full story-driven campaign.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brutal interstellar war is raging. Humanity has been forced to abandon much of the explored galaxy to a mysterious alien race. The aliens continue to hold the initiative on the front lines, while their motives and ultimate goals remain unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a graduate of the Flight Academy, beginning your internship aboard the training carrier <strong>